==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{military}} An offensive [[military]] mission. Used originally to mean an attack from a fortress, but most commonly used today to describe a single mission by a military aircraft.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|sortie|d}}

# {{transitive}} To [[sally]].

====Antonyms====
* {{sense|an offensive military mission}} [[scramble]]

===Anagrams===
* {{alphagram|eiorst}}
* [[tories#English|tories]], [[Tories#English|Tories]]
* [[triose#English|triose]]

